  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ぜんしんが　きんにくの　かたまり。\nしょくしゅを　つかって　くりだす\nしめわざの　いりょくは　すさまじい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "온몸이 근육덩어리다.\n촉수를 사용해서 펼치는\n조르기 기술의 위력은 무시무시하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "全身都是肌肉。\n會用觸手施展絞技，\n威力無與倫比。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps est un amas de muscles.\nLa puissance des prises d’étranglement\nqu’il exécute avec ses tentacules est saisissante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Körper besteht gänzlich aus Muskeln.\nDie schiere Stärke seines Würgegriffs, bei dem\nes seine Tentakel einsetzt, ist sagenhaft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Todo su cuerpo es una mole de puro músculo.\nUtiliza los tentáculos para ejecutar técnicas de\nestrangulamiento con una formidable potencia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo corpo è un ammasso di muscoli.\nÈ in grado di stritolare con una potenza\nformidabile grazie ai suoi tentacoli.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A body made up of nothing but muscle makes\nthe grappling moves this Pokémon performs with\nits tentacles tremendously powerful.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "全身が　筋肉の　塊。\n触手を　使って　繰りだす\n絞め技の　威力は　凄まじい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "全身都是肌肉。\n会用触手施展绞技，\n威力无与伦比。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Todo su cuerpo es una mole de puro músculo.\nUtiliza los tentáculos para ejecutar técnicas de\nestrangulamiento con una formidable potencia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おのれのうでを　ためすべく　りくに\nあがり　たいせんあいてを　さがす。\nたたかいおえると　うみに　かえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "자신의 실력을 시험하기 위해\n육지로 올라가 대전 상대를 찾는다.\n싸움이 끝나면 바다로 돌아간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會為了試自己的身手\n而登上陸地尋找對手。\n戰鬥結束後就會回到海裡。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mû par le besoin de tester la force de ses bras,\nil se rend sur la terre ferme pour trouver\nun adversaire. Il retourne à l’eau après le combat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Um sein Können zu testen, kommt es an Land\nund begibt sich auf die Suche nach Gegnern.\nSind die Kämpfe vorbei, kehrt es ins Meer zurück.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se aventura en tierra firme para buscar rivales\ncontra los que luchar para medir su valía. Tras\nterminar el combate, regresa al mar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si spinge sulla terraferma in cerca di avversari\nda sfidare per mettere alla prova la propria\nforza. Terminata la lotta, ritorna in mare.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Searching for an opponent to test its skills\nagainst, it emerges onto land. Once the battle\nis over, it returns to the sea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おのれの腕を　試すべく　陸に\n上がり　対戦相手を　探す。\n戦い終えると　海に　帰る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会为了试自己的身手\n而登上陆地寻找对手。\n战斗结束后就会回到海里。",
      "language": {
